    "content": "# Phase 12 Documentation Index\n\nStatus: Implemented.\n\n## Required Deliverables\n\n| Deliverable | File |\n|---|---|\n| Research novelty statement | `docs/research/RESEARCH_NOVELTY_STATEMENT.md` |\n| Competitive positioning | `docs/research/COMPETITIVE_POSITIONING.md` |\n| Methodology | `docs/research/METHODOLOGY.md` |\n| System architecture | `docs/research/SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md` |\n| Detection algorithms | `docs/research/DETECTION_ALGORITHMS.md` |\n| Recommendation engine design | `docs/research/RECOMMENDATION_ENGINE_DESIGN.md` |\n| Evaluation setup | `docs/research/EVALUATION_SETUP_AND_RESULTS.md` |\n| Results tables | `docs/research/EVALUATION_SETUP_AND_RESULTS.md` |\n| Threats to validity | `docs/research/THREATS_TO_VALIDITY.md` |\n| Future upgrade implementation plan | `docs/research/MESA_UPGRADE_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` |\n| Product vision | `docs/guides/PRODUCT_VISION.md` |\n| User personas and flows | `docs/guides/USER_PERSONAS_AND_FLOWS.md` |\n| Feature scope and release plan | `docs/guides/FEATURE_SCOPE_AND_RELEASE_PLAN.md` |\n| Product language and terminology | `docs/guides/PRODUCT_LANGUAGE_AND_TERMINOLOGY.md` |\n| User guide | `docs/guides/USER_GUIDE.md` |\n| Developer guide | `docs/guides/DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md` |\n| Installation guide | `docs/guides/INSTALLATION_GUIDE.md` |\n| API documentation | `docs/api/API_DOCUMENTATION.md` |\n| Final demo script | `docs/demo/FINAL_DEMO_SCRIPT.md` |\n| Viva questions | `docs/research/VIVA_QUESTIONS_AND_ANSWERS.md` |\n\n## Build Order Traceability\n\n1. PostgreSQL persistence: Phase 1.\n2. Neo4j graph persistence: Phase 2.\n3. Hard-coded dependency detector: Phase 3.\n4. God Service detector: Phase 4.\n5. Health score: Phase 5.\n6. Scan history/findings dashboard: Phase 6.\n7. Architecture graph dashboard: Phase 7.\n8. Snapshot comparison: Phase 8.\n9. Recommendation layer: Phase 9.\n10. Governance engine: Phase 10.\n11. Evaluation runner: Phase 11.\n12. Thesis documentation: Phase 12.\n"
